<Base
  title="WhatsApp Business App vs. WhatsApp Business API: What is the Difference? | LinkWA"
  description="Compare WhatsApp Business App vs. WhatsApp API. Learn about costs, features, multi-agent support, verification green tick, and automation capabilities."
